        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481640/extras/b5c0af4375077bd8e4172018cf724312.poster.avif?t=1778782593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481640/extras/b5c0af4375077bd8e4172018cf724312.webm?t=1778782593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481640/extras/b5c0af4375077bd8e4172018cf724312.mp4?t=1778782593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a hero to lead your army, and use spells while they fight for you. Mage &amp; Monsters 2 is an active auto battler, where you choose to either enhance the strength of your hero, reinforce the might of your army, or increase the power of your spells. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose between 18 different heroes to fight for you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 100 different upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 unique spells you can use in battle to help your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 25 different units you can recruit, and over 50 enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 different maps each with an unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cover Art by Dean Spencer.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481640/extras/b5c0af4375077bd8e4172018cf724312.poster.avif?t=1778782593\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481640/extras/b5c0af4375077bd8e4172018cf724312.webm?t=1778782593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481640/extras/b5c0af4375077bd8e4172018cf724312.mp4?t=1778782593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a hero to lead your army, and use spells while they fight for you. Mage &amp; Monsters 2 is an active auto battler, where you choose to either enhance the strength of your hero, reinforce the might of your army, or increase the power of your spells. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose between 18 different heroes to fight for you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 100 different upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 unique spells you can use in battle to help your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 25 different units you can recruit, and over 50 enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 different maps each with an unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cover Art by Dean Spencer.</i></p>",
